  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Partner Days 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands Embassy is inviting development partners to participate in the Sudan Development Partner Days, scheduled for 15-17 April 2025 in Nairobi. This event aims to bring together organizations working with Dutch funds to discuss their experiences, challenges, and opportunities in Sudan, especially in light of the ongoing conflict. A key focus will be on monitoring and evaluating the impact of programs in a volatile environment, as access to some parts of Sudan remains limited.</narrative>
  </description>
